{% comment %}
  ZAISEN Our Story — editorial workshop story, October 2026.
  Text-first by design: no stock photos, synthetic workshop imagery or unverifiable badges.
  Brand and production statements are supplied by the store owner.
  Returns text mirrors the published refund policy (eligible issues only).
  Delivery estimates mirror the currently configured Shopify shipping zones.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="zs-about" id="zs-about-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="zs-about-heading-{{ section.id }}">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context":"https://schema.org",
      "@type":"AboutPage",
      "name":"Our Story — ZAISEN Handmade Wooden Products",
      "url":{{ canonical_url | json }},
      "description":"Meet ZAISEN, the people behind our handcrafted wooden home decor. Learn about our workshop near Islamabad, our production process, worldwide shipping, and customer care.",
      "publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ZAISEN","url":{{ shop.url | json }}}
    }
  </script>

  <div class="zs-about__shell">
    <nav class="zs-about__breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Our Story</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="zs-about__hero">
      <div class="zs-about__hero-crest"><span class="zs-about__crest-rule"></span> THE PEOPLE BEHIND ZAISEN <span class="zs-about__crest-rule"></span></div>
      <p class="zs-about__overline">A SMALL WORKSHOP. A BIG LOVE FOR WOOD.</p>
      <h1 id="zs-about-heading-{{ section.id }}">Not just sold.<br><em>Made by our hands.</em></h1>
      <p class="zs-about__hero-lead">We are ZAISEN — a small team of makers creating handcrafted wooden pieces in our own workshop in the Saddar area near Islamabad, Pakistan. The pieces you see in our store are not finished goods we buy from local wholesale warehouses and relabel. We make the wooden products we offer, and we care about where each one comes from.</p>
      <p class="zs-about__hero-secondary">From a wooden wall clock that becomes part of a family room to a thoughtfully carved gift, our work begins with real material, time, tools and human hands. We want you to know the people and process behind your purchase, not simply click “Add to Cart” and hope for the best.</p>
      <div class="zs-about__hero-actions">
        <a class="zs-about__button zs-about__button--primary" href="#zs-about-workshop-{{ section.id }}">Visit our story <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
        <a class="zs-about__button zs-about__button--outline" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Ask us a question <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__hero-strip" aria-label="The ZAISEN approach">
        <span><b>01</b> Our own workshop</span>
        <span><b>02</b> Made by hand</span>
        <span><b>03</b> Tracked international shipping</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="zs-about__intro-grid" id="zs-about-workshop-{{ section.id }}">
      <div class="zs-about__intro-aside">
        <p class="zs-about__eyebrow">01 / OUR BEGINNINGS</p>
        <h2>Where our<br><em>story begins.</em></h2>
        <div class="zs-about__location-card">
          <span class="zs-about__location-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s7-5.4 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 5.6 7 11 7 11Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.4"/><path d="M2 21h20"/></svg></span>
          <div class="zs-about__location-details">
            <span class="zs-about__location-eyebrow">WHERE YOUR PIECES BEGIN</span>
            <h3>Our Own Woodworking Workshop</h3>
            <p>Saddar area, near Islamabad, Pakistan</p>
            <div class="zs-about__location-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p>This is where our wooden designs are shaped, refined and finished by our team — not sourced as finished products from wholesale warehouses.</p>
            <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" class="zs-about__location-contact">Questions about our workshop? Contact us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__prose">
        <p>ZAISEN grew from a simple belief: beautiful home objects should have a story you can understand. We love the warmth of natural wood, the care of traditional handwork and the tiny differences that make a handmade piece feel personal.</p>
        <p>Our workshop is a real place where wooden products are shaped, assembled and finished by our team. This is the heart of the business. We are not a catalog storefront forwarding orders to an unknown supplier, and we do not purchase ready-made wooden décor from local warehouses to pass it off as our own craftsmanship.</p>
        <p>We are a growing business, not a giant factory. That means we pay attention to the parts of a product that are easy to overlook: the edge of a bowl, the final sanding of a carved detail, how the wood feels in your hands and how safely the finished piece is packed.</p>
        <p>Our business administration and our production workshop are not the same location. Our published legal notice identifies <strong>Nexavio LLC</strong> and lists a business address in Denver, Colorado, United States. That business address is not our woodworking workshop or the place our wooden pieces are made. The hands-on workshop we describe here is based in Pakistan. You can check our <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}policies/legal-notice">legal notice</a> and <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">contact us directly</a> if you have questions. We prefer making this distinction clear rather than leaving you guessing about production or business details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zs-about__principle" aria-label="Our production commitment">
      <div class="zs-about__brand-panel">
        <a class="zs-about__brand-signature" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="ZAISEN home">
          {% if settings.logo != blank %}
            {{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 480 | image_tag: class: 'zs-about__brand-logo', loading: 'lazy', alt: 'ZAISEN handmade wooden products logo', widths: '240,360,480' }}
          {% else %}
            <span class="zs-about__brand-fallback">ZAISEN</span>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__principle-copy">
        <p class="zs-about__eyebrow">OUR COMMITMENT TO CRAFTSMANSHIP</p>
        <h2>Crafted by us.<br><em>Never simply resold.</em></h2>
        <p>We believe the story behind a wooden piece matters as much as the piece itself. Our team works in our own workshop, shaping and finishing the wooden products we offer. We do not buy finished wooden décor from local wholesale warehouses and present it as our own handiwork.</p>
        <p>From careful carving and sanding to final finishing and packaging, we take responsibility for the details. Our promise is simple: genuine craftsmanship, honest product information and a team you can contact whenever you need help.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zs-about__chapter">
      <div class="zs-about__section-heading">
        <div><p class="zs-about__eyebrow">02 / THE PROCESS</p><h2>From wood to something<br><em>worth keeping.</em></h2></div>
        <p>There is no magic button that makes a handcrafted piece. It takes a series of careful decisions — and we think you deserve to know what those are.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__process">
        <article class="zs-about__process-step"><span class="zs-about__step">01</span><h3>Choosing the wood</h3><p>We begin by considering the material and the shape we want to create. Natural grain and variations are part of the appeal; no two pieces of real wood have exactly the same character.</p></article>
        <article class="zs-about__process-step"><span class="zs-about__step">02</span><h3>Shaping by hand</h3><p>Our team works the material into the intended design using workshop tools and hands-on craftsmanship. Whether a piece is decorative or practical, form and proportion matter.</p></article>
        <article class="zs-about__process-step"><span class="zs-about__step">03</span><h3>Detailing and finishing</h3><p>Carving, refining edges, sanding, fitting components and finishing the surface help give each item its final feel. Some designs also need functional components such as clock movements or lamp hardware.</p></article>
        <article class="zs-about__process-step"><span class="zs-about__step">04</span><h3>Checking and packing</h3><p>Before dispatch, we check the finished product against its order and prepare it for the journey. Handmade wood deserves careful protection, especially when traveling internationally.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zs-about__two-col">
      <div class="zs-about__copy-card">
        <p class="zs-about__eyebrow">03 / HONEST PRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY</p>
        <h2>What you see<br><em>should make sense.</em></h2>
        <p>Our product listings feature the actual wooden product designs we sell. Some photographs are digitally refined, including AI-assisted adjustments to backgrounds, lighting or presentation, to create a consistent ZAISEN look. We want our store to look beautiful, but that should never be a substitute for clear product information.</p>
        <p>Because our items are handmade from natural wood, subtle differences in grain, tone, carving and finish can occur. Screens and lighting can also affect how colors appear. Those variations are normal; an incorrect item, genuine defect or a product materially different from its listing is another matter, and we want you to tell us about it.</p>
        <a class="zs-about__inline-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Have a product question? Contact us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__copy-card zs-about__copy-card--alt">
        <p class="zs-about__eyebrow">04 / WHAT WE MAKE</p>
        <h2>Wooden pieces for<br><em>the spaces you love.</em></h2>
        <p>Our collections bring natural warmth into everyday life: handcrafted wooden wall clocks, serving trays and bowls, tea and drinkware sets, home décor, sculptures, lighting and thoughtful gifts.</p>
        <p>Some pieces are meant to be useful every day. Others simply make a shelf, wall or table feel more like home. We care about both. Our aim is to make objects you enjoy giving, using and living with — not disposable trends.</p>
        <a class="zs-about__inline-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}collections/all">Explore our wooden collections <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="zs-about__shipping" aria-labelledby="zs-about-shipping-title-{{ section.id }}">
      <div class="zs-about__section-heading">
        <div><p class="zs-about__eyebrow">05 / FROM OUR HANDS TO YOUR HOME</p><h2 id="zs-about-shipping-title-{{ section.id }}">Made here.<br><em>Delivered worldwide.</em></h2></div>
        <p>We may be a small workshop, but our customers live around the world. We work with <strong>Star Cargo International</strong> and delivery partners to arrange international shipping, with tracking details provided when available after dispatch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__shipping-steps">
        <div><b>ONE</b><h3>Your order reaches us</h3><p>We review the items and delivery details, with a usual order-processing time of one day.</p></div>
        <div><b>TWO</b><h3>We pack it with care</h3><p>The wooden piece is checked and packaged to help protect it in transit.</p></div>
        <div><b>THREE</b><h3>We arrange dispatch</h3><p>International delivery is arranged through our shipping partners, including Star Cargo International.</p></div>
        <div><b>FOUR</b><h3>You follow its journey</h3><p>We share a tracking number when available so you can follow the shipment until delivery.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__shipping-summary">
        <div><strong>FREE</strong><span>Shipping to all 8 countries we currently serve</span></div>
        <div><strong>1 DAY</strong><span>Usual order processing before dispatch</span></div>
        <div><strong>TRACKED</strong><span>Tracking details shared when available</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__country-wrap">
        <h3>Where we deliver</h3>
        <p>Our currently supported delivery markets and estimated shipping times are shown below. Transit times are estimates, not guaranteed arrival dates, and exclude the usual one-day processing time.</p>
        <div class="zs-about__countries">
          <span>🇬🇧 <b>United Kingdom</b> <small>4–5 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇺🇸 <b>United States</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇩🇪 <b>Germany</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇫🇷 <b>France</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇦🇪 <b>United Arab Emirates</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇨🇦 <b>Canada</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇦🇺 <b>Australia</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
          <span>🇸🇦 <b>Saudi Arabia</b> <small>7–9 shipping days</small></span>
        </div>
        <p class="zs-about__fineprint">International customs, local duties or taxes, carrier conditions, weather and holidays can affect delivery. Any applicable charges not collected at checkout may be payable by the customer. See our <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}policies/shipping-policy">Shipping Policy</a> for full details.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="zs-about__assurance" aria-labelledby="zs-about-assurance-title-{{ section.id }}">
      <div>
        <p class="zs-about__eyebrow">06 / YOUR PEACE OF MIND</p>
        <h2 id="zs-about-assurance-title-{{ section.id }}">What if something<br><em>isn't right?</em></h2>
        <p>We know buying handmade décor from an online store can feel personal — especially when the package is coming from another country. You should feel comfortable asking questions before ordering and confident that we will listen if a genuine problem occurs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zs-about__assurance-main">
        <h3>14 days from delivery to report an eligible issue</h3>
        <p>If your wooden piece arrives damaged, defective, incorrect or with another genuine product issue — including a material mismatch with its description — please contact us within <strong>14 days of receiving your order</strong>.</p>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Tell us what happened.</strong> Email <a href="mailto:zaisenstore@gmail.com">zaisenstore@gmail.com</a> with your order number and a short explanation.</li>
          <li><strong>Show us the issue.</strong> Include clear photographs or a short video of the product; if transit damage occurred, photographs of the packaging are helpful.</li>
          <li><strong>We'll review it fairly.</strong> Depending on the circumstances and the published policy, a solution may include a replacement, repair, partial refund or full refund.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="zs-about__small-note">Natural variations in wood grain, tone and handmade details aren't automatically defects. Change-of-mind returns are not offered unless required by law. We don't promise automatic refunds for every claim, and your mandatory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p>
        <div class="zs-about__assurance-links">
          <a class="zs-about__button zs-about__button--primary" href="{{ routes.root_url }}policies/refund-policy">Read our Refund Policy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="zs-about__button zs-about__button--outline" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Contact ZAISEN <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

